WEBVTT

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.110
Do you think it's okay to
do something like this?

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.820
As an adult, aren't you embarrassed?

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.750
We're serious about this!

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.870
We... We don't have time to
be wasting on tricks-

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.540
Don't be mean to my father like that!

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.300
If you hate them, then spend the rest
of your life hating them!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.050
The occult! My dad!

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.010
Ami!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.260
What?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.390
Apologize to Maya-chan.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.210
Good morning, Ami-san!

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.050
Morning.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.520
G-Good morning, Maya-san...

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.800
Morning.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.360
Okay, let's start homeroom.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.320
Take your seats.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.550
Second base! Shortstop!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.430
Okay!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.740
Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.900
Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.780
Okay! Oka...

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.310
Guys, what are you doing?

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:40.490
My glasses. My glasses. My glasses...

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.570
Maya.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.320
After school, I'll be waiting
at Minakami Shrine.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:11.300
Hey, did you hear about the fake UFO?

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.970
Fake UFO?

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:16.850
I don't know who, but someone made
a fake UFO and flew it around.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.240
That's stupid.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:21.640
Maybe they were trying to take
advantage of that mystery circle?

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.280
And check this out!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.570
One of the students here was totally
fooled and went chasing after it.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:29.970
Seriously?

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.760
You know that pasture at
the foot of the mountain?

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.310
They took a pickup all the way down there.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.010
Really?

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:38.000
Wow, lame. If they can't tell the difference
between a real one and a fake,

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.070
they don't deserve to be students here.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:44.840
But you know, it's true that a bunch of
cows were found dead in that pasture.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.330
No way!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.780
A bunch of cows were found dead?

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.020
Yes.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.480
Come to think of it, they...

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.870
It must have been a mess
for you guys, too...

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.090
Getting a dead cow like that.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.440
Cow?

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.280
We didn't get any dead cow.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.620
Then, that was...

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.380
We should look into it again.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.340
Well?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.870
It's just like the last one.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.620
Almost every drop of blood's
been drained from its body.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:32.960
If this really was an alien's doing...

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.520
You truly are a moron.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.630
Wh-What?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.430
These are almost always just pranks.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:44.110
And sometimes, even if was a natural death,
they can appear to have been drained of blood.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:49.010
And it's possible that wild animals made it
look like the organs have been removed.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.230
Don't you know even that?

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.970
What's wrong with you?

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.200
What's wrong?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:58.280
You were the one who
wanted to investigate.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.330
I guess you're right...

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:04.050
And I'm pretty sure this isn't a prank.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.020
Look.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.170
Get a photo of this!

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:12.580
The scale is too big for a prank.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.290
What's this?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.990
She's late.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.620
She's late!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.280
You're late!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.660
Ami-san, you want to go home?

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.040
It's gonna get dark.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.230
I'm sure something came up.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:52.580
<i>Is this your answer, Maya?</i>

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:58.040
<i>Those two holes... That
was definitely...</i>

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.820
How long are you gonna keep
thinking in silence?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.800
You've been at it a while.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.980
Are you thinking about Kuroki?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.740
Wh-What do you mean, thinking about Ami?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.220
Oh, come on.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:12.040
I'm your teacher.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.550
I know you haven't made up yet.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.720
W-We don't really need to make up...

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.540
Bunmei! What time is it?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.250
Um, just after six.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.070
Oh, crap!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.010
Hey, wait! Where are you going?

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.310
<b>Minakami Shrine</b>

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:55.700
Maya.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.970
That's enough!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.490
This is the end of it!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.040
What are you doing?

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.790
Friends shouldn't have duels!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:14.600
I won't allow it.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.430
Huh?

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.090
I think you were a bit harsh, Maya-san.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.410
And you went a bit too far, Ami-san.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.760
But... But...

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:25.330
Oh, right. I know.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:29.530
Let's calm down and have a cold drink.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.410
Okay?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.500
I'll go buy something.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.330
She's gone...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.540
That girl...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.450
Hey.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.060
About what happened.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.970
I... I...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.480
Let me go!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.690
What is that?

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.920
What is that monster?

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.710
Are you okay, Kozue?

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.170
Yes...

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:24.130
It just bit me in the shoulder.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.930
Ami-san!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.510
Let me go!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.180
Damn it, what are these things?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.010
Ami-san!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:00.990
Ami...

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.380
Ow!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.590
You okay?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:28.610
My fingers! My fingers are for the
piano and the dowsing rods!

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:30.900
Hey, get to work!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.000
It's gonna get dark.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.880
Right.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:38.060
Why do we have to do this?

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.040
You say something?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.300
No! Nothing!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.160
Mister!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.830
What's wrong, guys?

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.150
Ami hasn't...

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.640
Ami-san was...

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.550
Ami-san was kidnapped!

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:17.290
Ami-san was kidnapped?

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.860
By who?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.140
It was one of those!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.030
Uh... What was it?

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:28.200
It attacks livestock...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.370
And it jumps...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.230
Yeah I've heard of it.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:36.210
What was it called again?

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.590
Sorry. I don't know much about that stuff.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.970
Um, it was...

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:47.000
A chupacha... Chupacha...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.180
A chupacabra!

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.050
Oh, right! That's it.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.250
Chupacabra?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.570
It means "goat-blood sucker" in Spanish.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.830
It was first seen in Puerto
Rico several years ago,

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:12.960
but eventually, witness reports spread
throughout South America,

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.620
recently making it to the US.

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:17.840
The strange cow deaths...

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.000
The way they died, the wounds on them...

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.010
And the way that thing looked.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.510
That was, without a doubt, a chupacabra.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.540
Is there really something like
that here, in this town?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.260
Yes. We must hurry, or Ami will...

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.650
All right.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.250
Sir.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.950
<b>Chupacabra</b>

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.100
Everyone onboard?

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.260
Yeah!

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:03.970
Hang on tight!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.070
Ow...

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.350
What happened?

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.440
My glasses... My glasses...

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.790
Sir, what's wrong?

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.830
Where is Ami?

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:31.560
What... What a fool I am!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:36.480
If I don't know where they took her,
I can't go save her!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.380
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:49.970
JK!

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.240
All the cows in the field?

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:59.700
And all of their blood was gone.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.860
How scary.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.720
Don't worry.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:08.560
No matter what happens, I'll protect you.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.000
Sensei...

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.980
Goodnight, then.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.060
Goodnight, sensei.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.930
This is the place?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.180
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.770
Let's go.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.000
This is really, really scary.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.500
But kinda fun.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.790
Is Ami-san really here?

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.710
Naruse?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.470
We're surrounded.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.550
Don't let down your guard.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.420
Same to you.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.960
R-Right.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.250
JK, which way is Ami?

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.700
Straight that way.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:06.890
Back there.

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.270
Let's hurry!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.910
There's no end to them.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:33.010
They just keep coming!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:38.110
We'll hold them off.

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:41.100
You get Ami, Maya-chan.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.830
B-But...

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.310
Go, Maya!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.660
Hurry!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:47.190
Don't worry about us.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:54.930
I want to see your faces,
once this is over and you make up.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.390
Guys...

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:03.920
In movies, everyone who
says those lines dies.

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:33.990
Ami?

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.060
Ami!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.450
Ami!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.780
Wake up, Ami!

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.180
Ami!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:04.850
Ami!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.520
Just hurry!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.410
Ami, I'm sorry about what happened.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.020
What I said about your father.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.030
Ami!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.620
I'm sorry, too!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.000
For slapping you and stuff.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.180
Die, monster!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:26.430
Your luck ran out the second
you touched my daughter.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.090
Sir!

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.270
Dad!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.810
We're getting out of here, guys.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.270
Yeah!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.020
We did it.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:38.530
Yeah.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.300
We did a lot.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.300
I'm alive.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.420
This wasn't it, either.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.860
Yeah.

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:57.570
What are you going to do about that?

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:01.040
The rest is up to the police.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:02.880
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.890
Wait a second.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.000
That's...

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:12.350
Man, I thought I was done for!

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:17.940
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:22.000
Doesn't something smell weird?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.830
Yeah, I guess so.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.610
Hey, what's that?

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:30.140
It's on fire!

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:32.640
Call the fire department!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:41.860
I took care of all the monster
corpses that were outside.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.350
Good work.

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:45.930
But I couldn't handle the ones inside.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.990
That fire won't be enough
to destroy the bones.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:50.540
Don't worry.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.310
They'll be told that wild dogs
were using it as a den.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:58.310
You keep your eyes on the principal.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.750
Maya, thanks.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:13.940
No, thank you.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:17.890
I-I'm so glad...

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:20.000
I thought you were going to have a duel...

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.750
We weren't, okay?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:27.060
Whenever we fought,
we always made up at Minakami Shrine.

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:29.010
Let's get home.

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.350
So, um, sir.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.960
If you wouldn't mind,

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:38.560
could you finish the story about
the red face in the window?

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:44.070
And so, trembling,

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:49.990
they opened the window,
where they saw the red face...

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.990
The house where you grew up,

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.140
the house with so many memories...

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.110
Do you have a place like that?

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:55.650
Memories of your parents from childhood?

00:23:55.650 --> 00:23:57.030
Where are you?

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:58.810
Where are you?

00:23:58.810 --> 00:24:00.550
Who are you?

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:02.900
My dowsing rods are picking something up!

00:24:02.900 --> 00:24:03.920
Another ghost?

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.710
Okay, take this!

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:06.860
Wait!

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:08.330
This girl is...

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:10.550
Next time on <i>Occult Academy</i>:

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.260
AKARI of snow.

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:14.770
It's occult, but I can't leave her alone...

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:20.010
This program is a work of fiction.
Departed spirits, psychic abilities,
aliens, UMAs, etc., do not exist.

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:20.010
Unless you believe in them...
